# Scene Transitions + Save/Load Position

## Contents
- MapTransitionTrigger
- SceneLoader (UniTask wrapper)
- SceneCtrl nhận OnMapLoaded
- WorldSaveData
- Save flow
- Load flow

---

## MapTransitionTrigger

Đặt Collider (isTrigger) ở rìa map hoặc cửa.

```csharp
public class MapTransitionTrigger : MonoBehaviour
{
    [SerializeField] string targetMapId;
    [SerializeField] string targetEntryId;

    [Inject] WorldSystem _worldSystem;

    void OnTriggerEnter(Collider other)
    {
        if (other.CompareTag("Player"))
            _worldSystem.TransitionTo(targetMapId, targetEntryId).Forget();
    }
}
```

Dùng `[Inject]` qua VContainer — không dùng `FindObjectOfType`.

---

## SceneLoader

Wrapper UniTask để load/unload scene additive.

```csharp
public class SceneLoader
{
    public async UniTask LoadAdditive(string sceneName)
    {
        await SceneManager.LoadSceneAsync(sceneName, LoadSceneMode.Additive)
                          .ToUniTask();
        SceneManager.SetActiveScene(SceneManager.GetSceneByName(sceneName));
    }

    public async UniTask UnloadScene(string sceneName)
    {
        var scene = SceneManager.GetSceneByName(sceneName);
        if (scene.isLoaded)
            await SceneManager.UnloadSceneAsync(scene).ToUniTask();
    }
}
```

---

## SceneCtrl nhận OnMapLoaded

Mỗi SceneCtrl lắng nghe `OnMapLoaded` để đặt player đúng vị trí.

```csharp
// trong FarmSceneCtrl (hoặc TownSceneCtrl)
protected override void OnEnter()
{
    GameBus.On<OnMapLoaded>(HandleMapLoaded);
}

protected override void OnExit()
{
    GameBus.Off<OnMapLoaded>(HandleMapLoaded);
}

void HandleMapLoaded(OnMapLoaded msg)
{
    if (msg.useEntryPoint)
    {
        // tìm EntryPoint trong MapConfig → teleport player
        if (_mapConfig.TryGetEntry(msg.entryId, out var entry))
            PlacePlayer(entry.position, entry.rotationY);
    }
    else
    {
        // mở game từ save → đặt nguyên vị trí đã lưu
        PlacePlayer(msg.savedPosition, msg.savedRotationY);
    }
}

void PlacePlayer(Vector3 pos, float rotY)
{
    _player.transform.SetPositionAndRotation(
        pos,
        Quaternion.Euler(0f, rotY, 0f)
    );
}
```

---

## WorldSaveData

```csharp
[Serializable]
public class WorldSaveData
{
    public string currentMapId;
    public SerializableVector3 playerPosition;
    public float playerRotationY;
}

[Serializable]
public struct SerializableVector3
{
    public float x, y, z;

    public static implicit operator Vector3(SerializableVector3 v)
        => new Vector3(v.x, v.y, v.z);

    public static implicit operator SerializableVector3(Vector3 v)
        => new SerializableVector3 { x = v.x, y = v.y, z = v.z };
}
```

---

## Save flow

Gọi tại 2 thời điểm:
1. **Trước khi unload scene** (trong `WorldSystem.TransitionTo`)
2. **Khi tắt game** (`Application.quitting`)

```csharp
void SaveWorldState()
{
    var data = new WorldSaveData
    {
        currentMapId    = _currentMap.mapId,
        playerPosition  = GetPlayerPosition(),
        playerRotationY = GetPlayerRotationY(),
    };
    _saveSystem.Save("world", data);
}
```

---

## Load flow

```
1. Boot scene khởi động
2. SaveSystem.Load("world") → WorldSaveData
3. Nếu không có save → dùng default (farm map, vị trí mặc định)
4. WorldSystem.LoadSavedMap(data)
   → LoadAdditive(farm scene)
   → Send OnMapLoaded { useEntryPoint = false, savedPosition = ... }
5. FarmSceneCtrl nhận → đặt player tại savedPosition
```

Boot scene là scene nhẹ, không có gì ngoài GameCtrl — load xong thì swap sang map scene.
